.TH LIBINPUT-RS 8 "July 2026" "libinput-rs 0.2.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
libinput-rs \- optional fail-open touchpad companion
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B libinput-rs
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B libinput-rs
creates a uinput pointer before exclusively grabbing supported physical
touchpads. Keyboards are observed without an exclusive grab for
disable-while-typing behavior. If the output device cannot be created or event
forwarding fails, the process exits and the kernel releases all grabs.
.PP
The service is disabled by default. It is not ordered before a display manager.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is read from
.IR /etc/libinput-rs/config.json .
.SH EXPERIMENTAL ABI LIBRARY
The experimental libinput ABI implementation is installed at
.IR /usr/lib64/libinput-rs/libinput.so.10 .
That directory is not in the system dynamic linker path. The library must not
replace the distribution-provided
.IR /usr/lib64/libinput.so.10 .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/libinput-rs/config.json
Daemon configuration.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/systemd/system/libinput-rs.service
Optional systemd service.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libinput (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
